KR-106 voice: precomputed DC-blocker coefficients, cached pitch/cutoff transcendentals

Not upstream (nura-builds). DcBlockPost{Osc,Vcf}: G/(1+G) precomputed (2 divisions per
oversampled sample less). ProcessSamplesAccumulating: powf(2, pitchMod) and, for J6/J60, the
logf/powf/logf cutoff + key-tracking term are recomputed only when their inputs change
(bit-identical output to the uncached code).

diff --git a/Source/DSP/KR106Voice.h b/Source/DSP/KR106Voice.h
index 6dc1ee2..646bfc8 100644
--- a/Source/DSP/KR106Voice.h
